  "Harry Potter and the Chamber of Secrets"
]

(If you expected a different ordering in the example you provided, note that "numbers come before letters" implies titles starting with digits should come before letter-starting titles; that is why "3 Little Pigs" appears before the letter-starting titles in the output above.)

